/// Uses the C++ defaults `sigma = 1.0`, `threshold_ratio = 0.01`, `nms_radius = 3`; [`shi_tomasi_corners_with_sigma`], [`shi_tomasi_corners_with_threshold_ratio`] and [`shi_tomasi_corners_with_nms_radius`] pass more arguments.
