/// - [`ErrorKind::LengthError`] (C++ `std::length_error`): If complete pair count cannot fit size_t.
/// - [`ErrorKind::ArithmeticError`] (C++ `std::overflow_error`): If arithmetic/counters or the selected legacy distance cannot fit.
///
