    ///
    /// # Arguments
    ///
    /// - `name`: A dataset name from catalog(), e.g. "iris" or "diamonds".
    ///
    /// Returns A new DataFrame owned by the caller.
    ///
    /// # Errors
    ///
    /// - [`ErrorKind::InvalidArgument`] (C++ `std::invalid_argument`): for an unknown name, an image dataset's name or karate_club.
    /// - [`ErrorKind::Native`] (C++ `std::runtime_error`): if a downloaded dataset is not cached and cannot be fetched.
